abstract: >
  Lean 4 formalization project for information geometry unifying Condensed Matter, Noncommutative Geometry,
  and Quantum Gravity. Features the ultimate theoretical capstone: formal verification of the Minkowski 
  causal cone as a Class DIII Topological Superconductor, with Andreev boundary scattering and 
  Hayden-Preskill fast scrambling preserved by Fibonacci anyon / MZM microstates. The structural closure 
  is governed by the Kasparov Intersection Product on a Doubled Krein space, absorbing the chiral 
  anomaly into the non-orientable Klein Bottle topology.
